# Generated by build.rs on every cargo build; the source of truth is src/.
/dist
/src-tauri/target
*.log

# A CAD-exported car, if you have one. Drop it here and both the browser and
# the desktop build pick it up; without it the procedural SDM26 body is drawn.
# Not committed: it is your model, it is large, and it is not the default.
/data/car.glb
/reference-car.glb

# A CAD wheel, same story as car.glb. 23 MB of Hoosier and OZ magnesium.
/data/wheel.glb

# Bodywork-only CAD (a CFD assembly). Also large.
/data/body.glb
